This file covers the theme package as a whole. Because SkynetRedBlack
bundles tinted derivatives of copyleft icon artwork, the package as
shipped cannot be covered by a single permissive license. The split
below is the license actually posted for this project and satisfies
GPL-3.0 §4/§5 and LGPL-3.0 (give recipients a copy of the license,
keep attribution, state that the adaptation is under the GPL/LGPL).

