   of Tela, licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.
   License text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt (verbatim, also
   https://github.com/vinceliuice/Tela-icon-theme/blob/master/COPYING)

2. Papirus icon theme + papirus-folders — GPL-3.0
